<h1>{{title}}</h1>
<p class="lead">
  A small team workspace built with NestJS and Nestvexa. Everything here runs in
  one Nest application with seeded, fictional data.
</p>
<section aria-labelledby="features-heading">
  <h2 id="features-heading">What you can try</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      A dashboard whose metrics update in realtime, next to a Vue chart island.
    </li>
    <li>
      A Live task board: search, filters, sorting, pages, a modal editor and
      file attachments.
    </li>
    <li>
      A three-step profile setup with server validation, drafts and a path that
      works without JavaScript.
    </li>
    <li>
      A Vue Inertia analytics section with server rendering and deferred data.
    </li>
    <li>
      Email notifications rendered with the same view engine (test transport).
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="workspaces-heading">
  <h2 id="workspaces-heading">Sample workspaces</h2>
  <ul id="workspace-list">
    {{#each workspaces}}
    <li><strong>{{name}}</strong>: {{tagline}}</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
</section>
{{#if signedIn}}
<p><a href="/app">Open your dashboard</a></p>
{{else}}
<p><a href="/login" id="home-sign-in">Sign in with a demo account</a></p>
{{/if}}
